{"page":5,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:25","surah":2,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"وَبَشِّرِ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ أَنَّ لَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ كُلَّمَا رُزِقُوا۟ مِنْهَا مِن ثَمَرَةٍ رِّزْقًا ۙ قَالُوا۟ هَـٰذَا ٱلَّذِى رُزِقْنَا مِن قَبْلُ ۖ وَأُتُوا۟ بِهِۦ مُتَشَـٰبِهًا ۖ وَلَهُمْ فِيهَآ أَزْوَٰجٌ مُّطَهَّرَةٌ ۖ وَهُمْ فِيهَا خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], give those who believe and do good the news that they will have Gardens graced with flowing streams. Whenever they are given sustenance from the fruits of these Gardens, they will say, ‘We have been given this before,’ because they were provided with something like it. They will have pure spouses and there they will stay.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَبَشِّرِ","en_gloss":"And give good news","transliteration":"wabashiri","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(to) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"[the] righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"(will be) Gardens","transliteration":"jannātin","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flow","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَحْتِهَا","en_gloss":"under them","transliteration":"taḥtihā","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۖ","en_gloss":"the rivers","transliteration":"l-anhāru","verse_key":"2:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كُلَّمَا","en_gloss":"Every time",